# Decompiled game scripts: CD Projekt Red's content, not ours. Regenerate any time with
#   java -jar tools/unluac.jar <game>/System/Scripts/<name>.luc > tools/decompiled/<name>.lua
tools/decompiled/

# Third-party binary, downloaded (github.com/HansWessels/unluac or the original by tehtmi)
tools/unluac.jar

# Upstream tarball; the patched source tree next to it is what actually builds
tools/lua-5.0.3.tar.gz

